  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "詞選及習作",
    "sub_ename": "SELECTION OF CI WITH WRITING PRACTICES",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在培養學生對詞學的認知與創作能力：在詞牌的認識上，能清楚認知詞體架構、格律、用韻，並能辨別不同詞牌之間的差異以及詩詞用韻的差別。在詞學發展史上，能夠了解詞的起源、轉變與發展，並能理解詞學特有的審美標準。在詞人的作品風格上，能認清唐五代至宋朝的詞學走向和風尚，並能擁有賞析、創作詞作的能力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to cultivate students' awareness and creative abilities in the field of Chinese poetics (Ci). For example, in terms of knowing the name of the tunes of songs, students will develop a clear understanding of the structure, metrical patterns, and rhyme scheme. They will also learn to differentiate between different poetic forms and recognize the differences in their rhyme schemes. In terms of the history of Chinese poetics (Ci), students will learn about its origin, evolution, and development and understand the unique aesthetic standards of Chinese poetics. \nRegarding the style of Ci writers, students will be able to recognize the trends and characteristics of Chinese poetry through Tang Dynasty, Five Dynasties, and Song Dynasty. They will also acquire the ability to appreciate, analyse and create Ci works.\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "學生能認識「詞」之為文體的寫作特色。",
      "describe_en": "Students can recognize the writing characteristics of the literary genre of \"Ci\"."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "學生能應用流暢的文字創作詞作，表達個人的意念與情感。",
      "describe_en": "Students can apply fluent writing to create Ci-style poetry, expressing their own ideas and emotions."
    }
  ],
